<title>FRANCE: Sommer-Allibert Q1 sales up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Sommer-Allibert Q1 sales up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover at Sommer-Allibert rose just over 11 percent in the first quarter, chairman Marc Assa told a news conference on Thursday.</p>
<p>Recalling that he was targeting a 10 percent rise in full-year sales, he said, &quot;At the end of March, we were right in the framework with sales up just over 11 percent&quot;.</p>
<p>Its 1996 first-quarter sales were 3.29 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
